# Line endings: LF in the repository AND in every working tree (Windows too).
# Prettier, ruff and the Linux containers all expect LF; with core.autocrlf=true
# and no rule here, Windows checkouts got CRLF and files showed up as modified
# after every format run. Binary files are detected automatically and marked below.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pkl  binary
